The numbers is a list of -4, -1, 0, 3, and 10.
The answers is a list of 5 zeros.
The left is 0.
The right is the last position of numbers.
The spot is the last position of answers.
Repeat while left is at most right.
The low is item left of numbers.
The high is item right of numbers.
If low times low is more than high times high, set item spot of answers to low times low, add 1 to left, otherwise set item spot of answers to high times high, subtract 1 from right.
Subtract 1 from spot.

For each value in answers, show value.
